DOC|subsystem_self_edit|v1|updated=2026-03-14c
META|inertia=LOW(tools)|parent=architecture_root.dsb
META|files=tools/self_edit.py,tools/hot_reload.py,cognition/forensic_logger.py

DESIGN_POINTS|
  DP1|patch_source_file preferred: line-range replacement + syntax check before write; fails safe
  DP2|edit_source_file: full rewrite; more dangerous; use only when patch can't express the change
  DP3|IGOR_SELF_EDIT_ENABLED gates all source file writes
  DP4|brainstem/ writes blocked regardless of gate (change.26)
  DP5|auto-commit+push after successful edit (Igor's edits only; CC edits do NOT)
  DP6|hot_reload: reload_module() after patch if module is stateless/hot-reloadable; else restart
  DP7|inertia_gate: validate_against_core() before response delivery; catches CP violations
  DP8|PROC_RELOAD_AFTER_EDIT: _try_hot_reload() in self_edit.py fires after edit/patch if IGOR_HOT_RELOAD=true + LOW inertia; else restart message

SELF_EDIT_FLOW|
  1=check inertia_registry.dsb for target module
  2=read file before editing (never overwrite blindly)
  3=check design_docs for relevant decisions
  4=patch_source_file (preferred) or edit_source_file
  5=run_syntax_check if not auto-run
  6=reload_module() if hot-reloadable; else schedule restart
  7=auto-commit+push

HOT_RELOAD|
  file=tools/hot_reload.py
  tools=reload_module(module_name),list_loaded_modules()
  blocked=brainstem/,memory/models.py,memory/cortex.py,reasoners/base.py,tools/registry.py,hot_reload.py itself
  auto_reregister=tool modules re-execute registry.register() calls on reload; no extra step needed
  shortname=accepts partial names; resolves if unambiguous
  auto=_try_hot_reload(path, label) called after successful edit/patch; gate=IGOR_HOT_RELOAD + label==LOW

FORENSIC_LOGGING|
  file=cognition/forensic_logger.py
  channels=reasoning_calls,ne_runs,self_edit,tool_calls,memory_ops,metrics,reading_progress
  format=prepend (newest at TOP); never truncate
  path=~/.TheIgors/logs/
  key_fns=log_pipeline_step(),log_error(),log_anomaly(),get_turn_id()

DECISIONS|D012,D024,D040,D041
KNOWN_FAILURES|F006(gateway-attr-error) — example of what bad self-edit looks like
